OL,9,FA man who drugged and raped his wife   
OL,10,Ffor more than 20 years wanted a        
OL,11,Fstranger to abuse her in a hotel room  
OL,12,Fwhile he filmed it, a court has heard. 
OL,14,FThe husband pleaded guilty in September
OL,15,Fto multiple offences from 2004 onwards 
OL,16,Fincluding rape, sexual assault and     
OL,17,Fadministering a substance with intent  
OL,18,Fto commit a sexual offence.            
